<title>UK: London &amp; Manchester H1 premium income rises.</title>
<headline>London &amp; Manchester H1 premium income rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.60		   vs 6.08</p>
<p> Premium income	   154.0		  vs 147.8</p>
<p> New business income    52.1		   vs 44.7</p>
<p> Unit trust sales	 2.7		    vs 8.1</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 28</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 1</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 23</p>
<p>Note - London &amp; Manchester Group Plc is life assurance, corporate pensions and financial services group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
